  "body": "## What changed\n\n- The post-merge gate failed on `egui_app::tests::setup_mount_pages::each_setup_picks_its_own_machine_and_post_and_posts_one_file_per_mount`. The post refused Face1 with 18 warnings.\n- Cause: PR #1622 (merge 53a77c9dc, #1607) added Face to `keep_law::is_stock_kept_kind`. A stock-source Face is now judged against the parts of the setup. PR #1634, PR #1640 and PR #1644 change only hole kinds. When Face is removed from the list, the test passes (checked, not kept).\n- Judgement: RIGHT. The fixture set a 60 x 60 x 20 stock under the seeded 60 x 60 x 30 block. It faced at Z 19.5 through the block, and the 25 mm clearance plane was inside the block. Before PR #1622, the post accepted a program that cut the part.\n- Fix (test only): the fixture stock is now 66 x 66 x 32 at (30, 30, 0) round the block. The face is at Z 31.5 and the clearance at Z 45. The Setup2 work offset moves to the new top (Z 32). The law is not changed.\n- New pin in the crate of the judgement: `a_face_of_a_stock_lower_than_the_part_cuts_the_part_and_never_posts` (`crates/app/tests/stock_source_law.rs`).\n- A 64 x 64 x 32 stock (2 mm side spare) gave one more `Gouge` on the last pass of the 4 mm mill, with no part present. This looks like a separate false positive. It is filed as #1659 (P3). The fixture uses a 3 mm spare.\n- Decision file: `docs/decisions/1657-face-post-judgement.md`.\n\n## How tested\n\n- The UI test: failed on origin/main, passes on this branch. All 4 `setup_mount_pages` tests pass.\n- App suites: `stock_source_law` (with the new pin), `mark_floor`, `keep_law`, `neighbour_law`, `stock_source_holes`, `stock_source_cross_drill`, `cross_drill_neighbours`, `engrave_law`. All pass.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- I did not run the new pin with Face removed from the keep law.\n- No other UI suites, no batch tier, no heavy lanes. No golden or snapshot changes.\n- I did not check if #1659 occurs before the four merges.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: high\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nFixes #1657\n",
